{"provider":"github","id":"7264","externalId":"5814419298","revision":"2026-10-12T13:50:20Z","type":"issue","title":"test: flake.Quarantine has 0% coverage","body":"**What is wrong:** `Quarantine(t, issue, expires)` in `internal/flake/quarantine.go:23` measures 0.0% coverage. It is the bounded-quarantine enforcement path (owner/expiry), so regressions would silently allow anonymous skips.\n\n**Scope:** add tests for valid issue+future expiry (skips), missing issue, malformed expiry, and expired quarantine.\n\n**Acceptance:** Quarantine coverage reaches all branches; `go test ./internal/flake` passes.\n\nConfidence: high (lens: test-coverage)\n\n_Evidence footer: quality-sprint collate stage findings (this run's collated report)._\n\nNomination key: qs/test-coverage/internal/flake/quarantine.go#Quarantine\n","labels":["area:hygiene","goobers:approved","goobers:ready","goobers:claimed","goobers:nominated","type:chore","goobers:cloud"],"state":"open","status":"open","links":[{"rel":"self","url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7264"}],"url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7264","createdAt":"2026-10-12T13:18:33Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-12T13:50:20Z","readyAt":"2026-10-12T13:41:17Z","fields":{"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-12T13:18:33Z","id":5814419298,"issue_dependencies_summary.total_blocked_by":0,"locked":false,"number":7264,"state":"open","title":"test: flake.Quarantine has 0% coverage","updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:50:20Z","user.login":"goobersbot[bot]"},"raw":{"id":5814419298,"number":7264,"title":"test: flake.Quarantine has 0% coverage","body":"**What is wrong:** `Quarantine(t, issue, expires)` in `internal/flake/quarantine.go:23` measures 0.0% coverage. It is the bounded-quarantine enforcement path (owner/expiry), so regressions would silently allow anonymous skips.\n\n**Scope:** add tests for valid issue+future expiry (skips), missing issue, malformed expiry, and expired quarantine.\n\n**Acceptance:** Quarantine coverage reac